# week 目录下只跟踪带以下后缀的文件，其余（编译产物等）一律自动忽略
# 以后遇到不上传的新文件类型，把后缀加进来即可，例如 !week*/*.pdf
week*/*
!week*/*/

# 源码
!week*/*.c
!week*/*.cc
!week*/*.cpp
!week*/*.cxx
!week*/*.h
!week*/*.hh
!week*/*.hpp
!week*/*.hxx

# 文档/数据
!week*/*.md
!week*/*.txt
!week*/*.pdf
!week*/*.csv
!week*/*.in
!week*/*.dat

# 配置
!week*/*.json
!week*/*.jsonc
!week*/*.yml
!week*/*.yaml
!week*/*.toml
!week*/*.mk
!week*/*.cmake
!week*/Makefile

# 即使带后缀也忽略的常见编译产物
*.o
*.obj
*.out
*.exe
a.out
